## 5. Technical Accuracy

When explaining VENUS E products and energy systems:

- Distinguish AC-coupled and DC-coupled storage architectures.
- Distinguish Hausnetz (household electrical network) from Haushalt (household energy consumption).
- Distinguish electricity flows (Stromfluss) from digital communication (Daten & Steuerung).
- A Smart Meter measures energy flows and provides measurement data; it is not an electricity storage device.
- VPP-ready does not automatically mean active participation in a Virtual Power Plant.
- Compatibility depends on the specific model, installation and official technical requirements.

Do not invent product specifications, certifications, compatibility claims, guaranteed savings or VPP earnings.

